It requires two modules, and no module of birdtable's:

- go.yaml.in/yaml/v3 v3.0.6, under MIT and Apache-2.0 (its LICENSE and NOTICE), which reads
  Taskfile.yml.
- mvdan.cc/sh/v3 v3.14.1, under BSD-3-Clause. taskfile imports its syntax package alone, whose parser
  reads each command's shell as go-task's own interpreter, built on it, reads it; that package
  imports the standard library only.

go.sum also names the modules the syntax package's own tests take; none is in a build of taskfile.
